<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian O/N rates end at 20 pct in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>Hungarian O/N rates end at 20 pct in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates ended easier in quiet trading on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at around 20 percent, down from 20.125/20.375 percent at opening and also below Wednesday's close of 20.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
